Cell["\<\
Mathematica is a powerful piece of computational algebra software (which can \
also do a lot more!). In this notebook we look at a few examples. The \
\[OpenCurlyQuote]basics\[CloseCurlyQuote] section of this notebook roughly \
mirro rs the SymPy example notebook that can also be found in this repository.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.7921616985786667`*^9, 3.792161740350642*^9}, {
  3.792162700128433*^9, 3.7921627123232403`*^9}, {3.79239557221318*^9, 
